OL,13,     FJohannes Moser joins the Auckland
OL,14,     FPhilharmonia and conductor
OL,15,     FGiordano Bellincampi in
OL,16,     FTchaikovsky's Rococo Variations.
OL,17,     FThe orchestra also plays
OL,18,     FTchaikovsky's Capriccio Italien.
